(Oceanic Fleet Technical Procurement - Maritime Port Logistics and Freight Rules) '
(Document Ref: OML-PROC-POL-02 | Classification: Commercial In-Confidence) '
(Section 1: Customs, Freight, and Expedited Delivery Surcharges) '
(Standard maritime customs clearance fee: Flat $220 processing fee per consignment at all designated port hubs.) '
(Designated international port delivery hubs: Rotterdam \(Netherlands\), Singapore \(Jurong Port\), Houston \(USA\), and Busan \(South Korea\).) '
(Priority emergency freight surcharge: Flat $450 surcharge for expedited courier delivery to vessel berth within 72 hours of vessel port arrival.) '
(Hazardous material transport handling fee: $180 per consignment for shipments containing pressurized chemical seals, lubricants, or battery packs.) '
(International packaging standard: ISPM 15 heat-treated certified timber packaging is mandatory for all maritime cargo.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
