(Section 2: Port Storage, Demurrage, and Mandatory Inspection Certificates) '
(Port warehouse storage grace period: Consignments receive 5 free calendar days of secure bonded port storage upon cargo arrival.) '
(Excess demurrage storage fee: $45 per pallet per day charged following expiration of the 5-day grace period.) '
(Pre-shipment classification inspection certificate: Mandatory for all engine fuel injection parts and turbocharger bearings.) '
(Inspection certification fee: Flat $150 fee per certified component batch issued by DNV or Lloyd's Register.) '
(Delivery inspection protocol: Vessel receiving officer must sign goods receipt note within 24 hours of quayside delivery.) '
ET
endstream
